vironment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:33fa69c40119e32f26b1bdce52a7548a85977631ff02537f0606d38d78a72ef9","file":"preprints/Ground-state-condensation-in-the-dilute-hard-sphere-gas-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":69,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"85f7f6fcc21f5e8c1ae8598c5eeefb199bf222e36da8ce09eac313c4691bc538","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Ground-state-condensation-in-the-dilute-hard-sphere-gas-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:33fa69c40119e32f26b1bdce52a7548a85977631ff02537f0606d38d78a72ef9","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Ground-state-condensation-in-the-dilute-hard-sphere-gas-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L69"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{main:mixed}\nUnder the hypotheses of Theorem~\\ref{main:theorem}, the same lower\nbound holds for every sequence of density operators supported on the\nbosonic ground eigenspaces. In particular, it holds for the normalized\nground-space projections $\\Pi_k/\\Tr\\Pi_k$, and for every sequence of\nnormalized nonnegative ground functions."}
